 claim at the anchoring checkpoint cp28 rather than at D, which would either fabricate a disagreement or, with a doctored disposition set, assert completeness the producer never claimed. It is rejected because `claim_material.corpus_checkpoint` must be the propagation's OWN declared checkpoint (core §2.3.4, receipt §3): cp28's identity fields do not match the `{log_id, tree_size, root_hash}` the statement itself declares. Completeness never extends past D; the enlargement creates a fresh propagation duty instead (core §5.2).","type":"propagation-complete"},"claim_material":{"corpus_checkpoint":{"checkpoint_time":"2026-08-16T12:00:00Z","key_id":"sha256:b62e867fa2f33afe62d5d6b1642e1621d543307846b2a57b897e710919b76709","log_id":"sha256:f96bab99f35b3ca221f3f233369835c3ee222f4b2e6c00f84b3a24f840f017a0","root_hash":"sha256:2eb016e2d590ef42a1c41daf6fbd4a81f2955c22ef793cbebbf57694a910fdc4","signature":"base64:Q7I/gMe6Dsmazpsq185OPwZ8QtLaL9ZoCpABPi1k6OKv2RJC5gR06x+xAL+orE3+YPkCLnSrNRg11Z3H8KxCAw==","tree_size":28},"corpus_prefix":{"entries":[{"entry_index":0,"envelope":{"payload":{"ahl_version":"0.3","datasets":{"customers":{"authority":{"key_ids":["sha256:34750f98bd59fcfc946da45aaabe933be154a4b5094e1c4abf42866505f3c97e"],"producer":"producer-1"},"canonicalization":"jcs-v1","commitment_mode":"keyed","key_access":"authorized-verifiers-only"},"scores":{"canonicalization":"jcs-v1","commitment_mode":"plain","key_access":"not-applicable"}},"issued_at":"2026-08-16T12:00:00Z","keys":[{"key_id":"sha256:34750f98bd59fcfc946da45aaabe933be154a4b5094e1c4abf42866505f3c97e","pubkey":"base64:iojj3XQJ8ZX9UtstPLpdcspnCb8dlBIb83SIAbQPb1w=","valid_from_index":0}],"level":"L3","log":{"adaptor":{"hash":"sha256:13edfdb0e2179aae0e9b94174fe37502686e404db42740aad1fb9f79e4832bfa","id":"ahl-test-log-v1"},"checkpoint_cadence":"PT1H","id":"sha256:f96bab99f35b3ca221f3f233369835c3ee222f4b2e6c00f84b3a24f840f017a0","keys":[{"key_id":"sha256:b62e867fa2f33afe62d5d6b1642e1621d543307846b2a57b897e710919b76709","p